:"盗みはしたくない！","nextNodeIds":[3750113]},{"nodeId":3750111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":286848979,"text":"さあ、話そう。好きなだけ話すことこそ、自由ってものだろう？","nextNodeIds":[3750112]},{"nodeId":3750113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":2818651907,"text":"はははっ、君、最初からそれはないよ。","nextNodeIds":[3750114]},{"nodeId":3750114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":2943201091,"text":"真面目に言うとさ、ボクより君のほうが向いてると思うんだ。","nextNodeIds":[3750115]},{"nodeId":3750115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":2749451635,"text":"だってボクは歌うこと以外、長所といえる長所はないからね。","nextNodeIds":[3750116]},{"nodeId":3750116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":3254969083,"text":"それにボクは一人ぼっち、捕まったら冤罪を晴らしてくれる人もいない。きっと重罪に問われる。","nextNodeIds":[3750117]},{"nodeId":3750117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1400936779,"text":"泥棒して捕まったなら、別に冤罪じゃないだろ。","nextNodeIds":[3750118]},{"nodeId":3750118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":1430574723,"text":"#でも{NICKNAME}は違う。君はモンドに貢献した、騎士団の未来のスターだから。","nextNodeIds":[3750119]},{"nodeId":3750119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":1052390115,"text":"ミスしてもちゃんと説明したら、誤魔化せるかもしれない。","nextNodeIds":[3750120]},{"nodeId":3750140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":469666899,"text":"それに、ここの守衛たちは夜になると帰っちゃうらしいよ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":3750141,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":2509381379,"text":"タイミングをちゃんと狙えば、ミスをしたくてもできないと思うんだ…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":3750120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3529806251,"text":"ミスを前提に考えるな！","nextNodeIds":[3750121]},{"nodeId":3750122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","tex